{"id":"vod_sn_39016","vodId":"39016","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"银河英雄传说 Die Neue These 星乱","name_cn":"银河英雄传说 Die Neue These 星乱","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/cac588334aa6fe6efef4d1706a303d26.jpg"},"summary":"数千年后的未来，进入宇宙空间的人类，被分为银河帝国与自由行星同盟这两个拥有“专制政治”与“民主主义”两种不同政治体制的国家。两国之间的抗争持续了150年，以无边无际的广袤银河为舞台，重复着无止境的战斗。银河帝国的门阀贵族社会的腐败，以及在自由行星同盟中被称为“民主主义的弊端”的群愚政治正侵蚀着两个国家。之后，宇宙历8世纪末，两位天才的登场驱动了历史。“常胜的天才”莱因哈特·冯·罗严克拉姆，以及人称“不败的魔术师”的杨威利。两人率领着帝国军与同盟军，展开了不知道是第几次的冲突。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:37","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wUgRJ19KjA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TKBsebiHw91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eDEXDQQppm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uWZxR2W9151/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vzRd6mQxfG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Z6qzzMCVs51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JKp3JAxbiC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GprYVscy1n1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WnbGFah89Q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YfBz4CDze61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SAdqbV9ip81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FahPTTpE5p1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:51.496Z"}